<title>MALAYSIA: Tenco approves sale of Singapore unit.</title>
<headline>Tenco approves sale of Singapore unit.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's Tenco Bhd said it has approved the sale of Tenco Startech Pte Ltd, a Singapore-incorporated company, for Singapore $637,500.</p>
<p>The sale of the 255,000 shares at S$2.50 in Tenco Startech will net a gain of S$382,000 for Tenco Western Industries Pte Ltd, which owns a 51 percent stake in the company, a Tenco group statement said.</p>
</text>
